	(text "ID_SD and ID_SC PINS:\nAt boot time this I2C interface will be\nused to identify the attached board and\nallows automagic setup of the GPIOs\n(and optionally, Linux drivers).\n\nWP is pulled high for normal write\nprotection. Pull WP low during\nEEPROM programming."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 117.348 185.928 0)
		(effects
